  "receiver": {
    "type": "GuiLaw private receiver",
    "calling_convention": "Microsoft x64; RCX is this and AL carries bool results",
    "layout": {
      "+0x00": "CLaw pointer",
      "+0x08": "captured played-character identity pointer; +0x08 is compared byte-for-byte as int32 with module+0x4FE7EE0"
    },
    "resolution": "0x3DDF770 requires the captured identity to equal the current played CharacterID, generation-resolves that ID through storage module+0x570C130 with fallback module+0x570C138, requires CCharacter+0x1B8, rejects an invalid or already-active law, then calls 0x2C7D930 with R8=null",
    "no_pointer_cache": "the command path carries a CLaw pointer only inside the engine-owned CAddLawCommand clone; callers must rebuild the GuiLaw receiver and re-run the final evaluator before each submission"
  },
  "call_chain": {
    "reflection_registration": "0x7DF870 [0x7DF870,0x7DF934) registers the literal Enact with callback 0x3DE0880",
    "gui_entry": "0x3DE0880 [0x3DE0880,0x3DE089C) checks RCX and calls 0x3DDF8C0",
    "gui_enact": "0x3DDF8C0 [0x3DDF8C0,0x3DDF9BC) re-runs 0x3DDF770, builds a 0x168-byte CEnactLawConfirmationPopup, and retains the target CLaw at popup+0x160",
    "confirmation": "CEnactLawConfirmationPopup primary vtable+0x48 is 0x3DDEEC0; it builds a 0x30-byte CAddLawCommand and calls 0x973E00 with manager module+0x57621F0 and flags 0x0E",
    "clone_and_queue": "0x973E00 calls CAddLawCommand primary vtable+0x40 to clone, then calls locked queue entry 0x341D990; its AL return is queue acceptance only",
    "command_validation": "CAddLawCommand primary vtable+0x30 is 0x25E2690; it resolves command+0x20 CharacterID and tail-calls 0x2C7DAA0(target CLaw, CCharacter, error sink), which reaches the same final evaluator 0x2C7D930",
    "command_execution": "CAddLawCommand primary vtable+0x38 is 0x803620, which adjusts this by +0x18 and enters 0x26B2750. Its 0x26B27D5 call reaches 0x26B2890; callsite 0x26B29BC invokes secondary vtable+0x08, 0x25E2640. Secondary this is primary object+0x18, so the leaf reads CharacterID at secondary+0x08 and CLaw at secondary+0x10, resolves the character, and tail-calls 0x260ACB0(character, law, 7, null)",
    "mutation": "0x260ACB0 [0x260ACB0,0x260AD6A) builds a transient law mutation context with 0x25FEF00, selects the existing entry whose CLaw+0x38 value equals target CLaw+0x38, calls logical apply routine 0x25FF0F0, and invokes finalizer 0x25FEFA0. The apply span removes/compacts the old entry at 0x25FF1A2-0x25FF1F5, inserts the target at 0x25FF22F-0x25FF25B, and marks the change at 0x25FF267. The finalizer emits registered token 0x328A law_changed",
    "serialization": "CAddLawCommand primary vtable+0x80 is 0x25E26E0; it writes command+0x20 under registered native field tag 0x6EC character and serializes the target law persistent identity reached from command+0x28 under registered tag 0x2FF2 law. Primary vtable+0x88 is the continuous deserialization dispatcher 0x25E2780-0x25E2849, which handles those same tags and writes +0x20/+0x28"
  },
  "calling_conventions": {
    "0x3DDF770": "bool __fastcall(GuiLaw* this); AL result",
    "0x2C7D930": "bool __fastcall(CLaw* law, CCharacter* actor, void* optional_error_sink); RCX/RDX/R8, AL result",
    "0x2C7DAA0": "bool __fastcall(CLaw* law, CCharacter* actor, void* optional_error_sink); RCX/RDX/R8, AL result",
    "0x3DDEEC0": "void __fastcall(CEnactLawConfirmationPopup* this); RCX",
    "0x25E2690": "bool __fastcall(CAddLawCommand* this, void* optional_error_sink); RCX/RDX, AL result",
    "0x25E26E0": "void __fastcall(CAddLawCommand* this, void* archive_writer); RCX/RDX",
    "0x25E2780": "deserialize dispatch entry; RCX command, RDX archive reader, R8D native field tag",
    "0x973E00": "bool __fastcall(void* command_manager, void* command, uint32_t flags); RCX/RDX/R8D, AL queue result",
    "0x25E2640": "void __fastcall(void* secondary_this); RCX points to CAddLawCommand+0x18",
    "0x260ACB0": "void __fastcall(CCharacter* actor, CLaw* target, uint8_t source_code, void* optional_selection); RCX/RDX/R8B/R9",
    "0x25FF0F0": "void __fastcall(void* mutation_context, CLaw* target, void* selected_native_member); RCX/RDX/R8"
  },
